# WorkOS AuthKit factor management

- Keep WorkOS calls behind `packages/auth`; app settings must use `createWebAuthRuntime(...)` or package exports, never `@workos-inc/node` directly.
- TOTP can be listed/enrolled through WorkOS user-management auth-factor APIs and deleted through the MFA `deleteFactor` API. Verify factor ownership in `AuthRuntime` before deletion because the delete API accepts only a factor id.
- Passkeys are hosted-AuthKit only in current WorkOS docs/API. Do not promise custom passkey list/delete/enroll flows until WorkOS exposes server APIs; show a hosted-only/unsupported state instead.
